          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A magnetic power bank is the easiest way to keep an iPhone going, as long as you buy one with Qi2 certification and do not expect the number on the box to reach your phone. For most people, the Anker MagGo Power Bank (10K) is the right buy; for an iPhone 16 or 17, the Baseus PicoGo AM52 is faster.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
